---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      🚀 Offre de lancement — Mockup gratuit, sans engagement
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-h1">
      Votre site pro en 48h —<br>
      <em>pour artisans, restaurants<br>et indépendants.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      À partir de <strong>€290</strong> seulement — prix fixe, livraison garantie en 48h. Vous commandez aujourd'hui, vous êtes en ligne après-demain.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#mockup" class="btn-primary">Obtenir mon mockup gratuit →</a>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/hello-beyitworld/30min" target="_blank" class="btn-secondary">Parler à un conseiller</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">48h</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Délai garanti</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">€290</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Prix fixe, tout compris</span>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-item">
        <span class="proof-num">100%</span>
        <span class="proof-label">Satisfait ou on recommence</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.hero {
  padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.hero-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  background: var(--accent-pale);
  border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.2);
  color: var(--accent-dark);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.badge-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background: #22c55e;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: inline-block;
  animation: pulse 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.4; }
}

.hero-h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: #1a1a1a;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.hero-h1 em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--accent);
}

.hero-sub {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: #444;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  max-width: 520px;
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: var(--accent-light);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(16,185,129,0.25);
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-strong);
  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
}
.btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

.hero-proof {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
}

.proof-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.proof-num {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--accent);
}

.proof-label {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: #888;
  margin-top: 0.1rem;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .hero { padding: 3rem 1.25rem 2rem; }
  .hero-proof { gap: 1.5rem; }
  .btn-primary, .btn-secondary { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
}
</style>
